OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fsoon clearing to leave clear
OL,7,Fconditions for a time before cloud
OL,8,Fmoves in from the west. Rain, locally
OL,9,Fheavy, spreading into the region
OL,10,Fthrough the early hours. Winds
OL,11,Fstrengthening towards the end of the
OL,12,Fnight. Minimum Temperature 7C.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FCloudy and wet with rain
OL,15,Fbecoming heavy at times. Windy to
OL,16,Fstart with fairly widespread strong
OL,17,Fwinds during the middle of the day.
OL,18,FMaximum Temperature 11C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
