OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday,
OL,6,Fturning drier and brighter but chilly.
OL,7,FWinds gradually easing. Monday,
OL,8,Ffurther wet and windy conditions
OL,9,Fmoving east. Tuesday, dry and sunny.
